      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُقَارَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>quantity</i> [of grain] <i>which a bird
pecks,</i> or <i>picks up.</i> (K.) See 8, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قب</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<i>What remains from the boring,</i> or <i>excavating,</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقْر</span>,) <i>of stones:</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُجَارَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُحَاتَةٌ</span>. (TA.)

